[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_gd47x"]
script = ExtResource("3_gs3kc")
_btn_text = "Look over the track"
_modal_text = "The course winds through an old freight yard near the docks. Packed dirt covers most of the track, though several stretches still run across uneven cobblestones.

Wooden barriers separate the course from the spectators. Stacked crates, warehouses, and tall loading cranes loom beyond them, giving the circuit a distinctly urban character."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_pkmrc"]
script = ExtResource("3_gs3kc")
_btn_text = "Observe the crowd"
_modal_text = "Dockworkers, merchants, sailors, mercenaries, and travellers crowd the stands. Hawkers weave between them, selling beer, fried fish, racing ribbons, and hastily printed betting sheets.

The sport may still be new, but Harbortown has embraced it eagerly. Every merchant seems determined to find some way of making money from the spectacle."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_lhalu"]
script = ExtResource("3_gs3kc")
_btn_text = "Study the competition"
_modal_text = "The competition looks serious and invested. Several mares wear polished racing gear, and a few of the jockeys carry themselves with obvious confidence.

Most are still converted work or warband ponygirls rather than dedicated racers, but word of the sport is spreading quickly. Some competitors have clearly begun training specifically for the track."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_walxc"]
script = ExtResource("3_gs3kc")
_btn_text = "Inspect the starting area"
_modal_text = "A row of sturdy starting stalls stands beneath a large painted sign bearing the emblem of Harbortown. Officials in matching blue coats inspect equipment, register competitors, and argue with bookmakers attempting to approach the jockeys."

